GPS Spot-Lock Trolling Motor - Parts List

Hey,

Here are the parts lists for the DIY GPS spot-lock trolling motor project.

Two files attached:

1. parts_list.csv - Full bill of materials (40+ parts)
   Every part with description, quantity, low/high price,
   recommended flag, store name, and direct purchase link.

   Categories: Motor, Steering, Controller, GPS, IMU/Compass,
   Wind Sensor, Fishing Sensors, Camera/ML, Power, Safety,
   Wiring, Enclosures, Misc.

2. budget_tiers.csv - Three build options
   Budget:    ~60  (standard GPS, mechanical wind, no camera)
   Mid-Range: ~66  (better GPS, ultrasonic wind, RPi camera, LiFePO4)
   Full:      ~,615 (RTK GPS, Coral TPU, Dakota Lithium)

Open in Excel or Google Sheets - all links are clickable.

Main stores to order from:
- Amazon (most electronics + wiring)
- SparkFun (GPS modules)
- Adafruit (RPi, IMU, temp sensor)
- DFRobot (steering servo, wind sensor)
- Bass Pro Shops (trolling motor, mount, marine battery)
- Dakota Lithium (premium LiFePO4 battery)
- Renkeer (ultrasonic wind sensor)
- Coral.ai (ML accelerator)

